WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:03.363
Be still, and know that I am God.

00:00:03.363 --> 00:00:07.706
Let distracting thoughts pass rather than chasing them.

00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:13.424
You do not have to solve every feeling or hurry toward a spiritual experience.

00:00:13.424 --> 00:00:16.730
Receive whatever stillness is available.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:21.102
Focus on the divine Father, approached through Jesus.

00:00:21.102 --> 00:00:26.469
Present your needs, your calling, and your daily practices to God.

00:00:26.469 --> 00:00:33.531
Tell Him what you hope for, what you fear, and what you are trying to do with the life He has given you.

00:00:33.531 --> 00:00:36.880
Surrender your desires and choices.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.437
You are not alone, and you do not need to carry this commitment by yourself.

00:00:42.437 --> 00:00:46.049
Let honesty take the place of performance.

00:00:46.049 --> 00:00:49.471
Receive what is already yours in Christ.

00:00:49.471 --> 00:00:52.981
Stay in this place for a moment and listen.

00:00:52.981 --> 00:00:54.911
Now listen.
